# Scripted events for the "lifts" recording (single notes), in ms on the recording's clock.
# The first part transposes while a note is held, then returns to no transposition. The second presses
# a sustain pedal while a note is held, and the last line queries a setting by NRPN.

setting switch2 transposeUp            # the switches these events use; the others keep their defaults
setting switch1 transposeDown
setting footLeft sustain

45200   press switch2                  # Transpose Up, a note held (44.75-46.65 s)
45350   release switch2
105500  press switch2                  # Transpose Up again, a note held (105.15-107.75 s)
105650  release switch2
106600  press switch1                  # Transpose Down, twice: back to no transposition
106750  release switch1
107200  press switch1
107350  release switch1

128000  press footLeft                 # the sustain pedal down, a note held (127.75-129.4 s)
131000  release footLeft

132000  nrpn 299 259                   # query: Global MIDI CC For Foot Left Sustain
